{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1646092800, "end_date": 1646783999, "month_true_total": 593, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:48:40 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "111827997", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974151926", "personaname": "Maine_Man", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974151926/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 10560, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 585, "last_played": 1771878962, "avatar": "cc06122300efe7023f2b23ac85dc96b0b264d033"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1646776964, "timestamp_updated": 1646776964, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49380803108215332", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111825913", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989945278", "personaname": "`redSHOT", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/redX13/", "num_games_owned": 65, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 23526, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5170, "last_played": 1741321251, "avatar": "7ac0f5ebd1d3274a62b5e56bce18ae7e12739094"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun.", "timestamp_created": 1646774031, "timestamp_updated": 1646774031, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.46690899133682251", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111823019", "author": {"steamid": "76561198151091535", "personaname": "♡ Catpurrccino ♡", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198151091535/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 19115, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6094, "last_played": 1768524986, "avatar": "e330ce5566c7e9a44558a42ddb40a21b974b23dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "I personally like the game, I can't wait for new content and stuff. Yes its grindy if you want the cards and clothes but overall I have a good time playing it over and over with my friends. People who want to compare it to left 4 dead are a little over the top, and try to steer you away from a perfectly decent game and co-op experience. If you can't stand the grind this isn't for you. I think the card system is kind of cool too, gives the game stupid builds and strats or really good ones to help you and your team get through nightmare. Not a bad thing they made nightmare insanely hard, hardest difficulties are supposed to be hard right? Either way I love the game, its the best with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1646770252, "timestamp_updated": 1646770252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111822799", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360907783", "personaname": "Goobs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mikegoobs/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7095, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2097, "last_played": 1731478046, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game can be fun when you are with 3 friends but any less and you get stuck with randoms that don't know how to play the game and refuse to cooperate. I had a teammate literally troll me and my team by simply not playing, which causes the game to never end in some parts of the map if the whole team does not progress. So just imagine it taking over 30 min to clear one stage(typically 5-10 min) because some troll doesn't want to actually play the game. Do yourself a favor and buy literally any other zombie game.", "timestamp_created": 1646769991, "timestamp_updated": 1646769991, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.463145792484283447", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111809767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010737775", "personaname": "Rock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/null_rock/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 758, "last_played": 1646675862, "avatar": "16651a6c67691ffcc705e0dc28258afe2e88ca47"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was quite fun the first time, completing the campaign with friends and stuff, but after that there's not much to do and most of it is rather the same, but i definitely did have fun during the campaign. Definitely worth the try if you were into the left for dead franchise, especially if it is on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1646754102, "timestamp_updated": 1646754102, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111787588", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993728542", "personaname": "Chaos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thermalevon/", "num_games_owned": 135, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 7624, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7624, "last_played": 1646719499, "avatar": "3bb6b278f04cef8d5421b37df8abcbfa60c8c5aa"}, "language": "english", "review": "been working to finish my last achievement... was feeling really good about it and finally able to table this game for a little bit with a 100% completion. But in the literal 24 hours since I played last they added new achievements which you can't even get. Upsetting to grind the original achievements only to have the finish line moved behind a wall incapable of scaling the literal day i get to perfect finish it. i will be tabling this and they will be lucky to see me back for a very long time.", "timestamp_created": 1646720274, "timestamp_updated": 1646720274, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50751882791519165", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}